<form version="1.1">
  <label>AD Replication &amp; Sync Health</label>
  <description>State of Active Directory replication between domain controllers: per-link status (last success, lag, last result) from MSAD:NT6:Replication, replication-related Directory Service and DFSR events (KCC, lingering objects, tombstone lifetime, DNS failures, USN rollback), sync start/end audit events, and Kerberos clock-skew failures.</description>
  <fieldset submitButton="false" autoRun="true">
    <input type="time" token="time">
      <label>Time range</label>
      <default>
        <earliest>-7d@h</earliest>
        <latest>now</latest>
      </default>
    </input>
  </fieldset>

  <row>
    <panel>
      <title>DCs reporting replication status</title>
      <single>
        <search>
          <query>`adx_repl_data` | stats dc(host)</query>
          <earliest>-30m</earliest>
          <latest>now</latest>
        </search>
        <option name="drilldown">none</option>
        <option name="height">100</option>
      </single>
    </panel>
    <panel>
      <title>Failing replication links</title>
      <single>
        <search>
          <query>`adx_repl_links` | where last_result!="0" | stats count</query>
          <earliest>-24h</earliest>
          <latest>now</latest>
        </search>
        <option name="drilldown">none</option>
        <option name="height">100</option>
        <option name="colorMode">block</option>
        <option name="useColors">1</option>
        <option name="rangeValues">[1]</option>
        <option name="rangeColors">["#65A637","#B0413E"]</option>
      </single>
    </panel>
    <panel>
      <title>Max time since last success (min)</title>
      <single>
        <search>
          <query>`adx_repl_links` | stats max(lag_min)</query>
          <earliest>-24h</earliest>
          <latest>now</latest>
        </search>
        <option name="drilldown">none</option>
        <option name="height">100</option>
        <option name="colorMode">block</option>
        <option name="useColors">1</option>
        <option name="rangeValues">[60,240]</option>
        <option name="rangeColors">["#65A637","#FFC300","#B0413E"]</option>
      </single>
    </panel>
    <panel>
      <title>Replication error events</title>
      <single>
        <search>
          <query>`adx_ds_events` EventCode IN (1308,1311,1388,1566,1865,1925,1988,2042,2087,2088,2095,2213,4012) | stats count</query>
          <earliest>$time.earliest$</earliest>
          <latest>$time.latest$</latest>
        </search>
        <option name="drilldown">none</option>
        <option name="height">100</option>
        <option name="colorMode">block</option>
        <option name="useColors">1</option>
        <option name="rangeValues">[1,10]</option>
        <option name="rangeColors">["#65A637","#FFC300","#B0413E"]</option>
      </single>
    </panel>
    <panel>
      <title>Critical events (lingering objects, tombstone, USN rollback)</title>
      <single>
        <search>
          <query>`adx_ds_events` EventCode IN (1388,1988,2042,2095,4012) | stats count</query>
          <earliest>$time.earliest$</earliest>
          <latest>$time.latest$</latest>
        </search>
        <option name="drilldown">none</option>
        <option name="height">100</option>
        <option name="colorMode">block</option>
        <option name="useColors">1</option>
        <option name="rangeValues">[1]</option>
        <option name="rangeColors">["#65A637","#B0413E"]</option>
      </single>
    </panel>
    <panel>
      <title>Minutes since last replication event</title>
      <single>
        <search>
          <query>`adx_repl_data` | stats max(_time) as t | eval m=round((now()-t)/60,0) | fields m</query>
          <earliest>-24h</earliest>
          <latest>now</latest>
        </search>
        <option name="drilldown">none</option>
        <option name="height">100</option>
        <option name="colorMode">block</option>
        <option name="useColors">1</option>
        <option name="rangeValues">[30]</option>
        <option name="rangeColors">["#65A637","#B0413E"]</option>
      </single>
    </panel>
  </row>

  <row>
    <panel>
      <title>Replication links - current state</title>
      <html><p>dc = DC that receives the changes, partner = replication source (src_host). Source: MSAD:NT6:Replication (LastSuccessfulSync / LastAttemptedSync / Result; Result 0 = success). LATE = no successful sync for more than 4 hours.</p></html>
      <table>
        <search>
          <query>`adx_repl_links` | eval last_success=strftime(last_success_epoch,"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M"), last_attempt=strftime(last_attempt_epoch,"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M"), status=case(last_result!="0","FAILING", lag_min&gt;240,"LATE", true(),"OK") | sort - status, - lag_min | table dc partner naming_context transport status last_success last_attempt lag_min last_result</query>
          <earliest>-24h</earliest>
          <latest>now</latest>
        </search>
        <option name="drilldown">none</option>
        <option name="count">15</option>
        <option name="wrap">true</option>
        <option name="rowNumbers">false</option>
        <format type="color" field="status">
          <colorPalette type="map">{"OK":#65A637,"LATE":#F8BE34,"FAILING":#B0413E}</colorPalette>
        </format>
      </table>
    </panel>
  </row>

  <row>
    <panel>
      <title>Failed replication events by DC</title>
      <chart>
        <search>
          <query>`adx_repl_data` | where Result!="0" | timechart span=1h count by host</query>
          <earliest>$time.earliest$</earliest>
          <latest>$time.latest$</latest>
        </search>
        <option name="charting.chart">column</option>
        <option name="charting.chart.stackMode">stacked</option>
        <option name="charting.legend.placement">bottom</option>
        <option name="charting.drilldown">none</option>
        <option name="height">280</option>
      </chart>
    </panel>
    <panel>
      <title>Replication-related events over time</title>
      <chart>
        <search>
          <query>`adx_ds_events` EventCode IN (1308,1311,1388,1566,1865,1925,1988,2042,2087,2088,2095,2213,4012) | timechart count by EventCode</query>
          <earliest>$time.earliest$</earliest>
          <latest>$time.latest$</latest>
        </search>
        <option name="charting.chart">column</option>
        <option name="charting.chart.stackMode">stacked</option>
        <option name="charting.legend.placement">bottom</option>
        <option name="charting.drilldown">none</option>
        <option name="height">280</option>
      </chart>
    </panel>
  </row>

  <row>
    <panel>
      <title>Directory Service / DFSR replication events</title>
      <table>
        <search>
          <query>`adx_ds_events` EventCode IN (1308,1311,1388,1566,1865,1925,1988,2042,2087,2088,2095,2213,4012) | rename EventCode as event_id | lookup adx_replication_events event_id OUTPUT description severity | eval dc=coalesce(Computer, ComputerName, host), message=substr(coalesce(Message, _raw),1,300) | sort - _time | table _time dc event_id severity description message</query>
          <earliest>$time.earliest$</earliest>
          <latest>$time.latest$</latest>
        </search>
        <option name="drilldown">none</option>
        <option name="count">10</option>
        <option name="wrap">true</option>
        <option name="rowNumbers">false</option>
        <format type="color" field="severity">
          <colorPalette type="map">{"critical":#B0413E,"high":#F1813F,"medium":#F8BE34}</colorPalette>
        </format>
      </table>
    </panel>
    <panel>
      <title>Replication errors by DC and event</title>
      <table>
        <search>
          <query>`adx_ds_events` EventCode IN (1308,1311,1388,1566,1865,1925,1988,2042,2087,2088,2095,2213,4012) | rename EventCode as event_id | lookup adx_replication_events event_id OUTPUT description | eval dc=coalesce(Computer, ComputerName, host) | stats count, latest(_time) as last by dc event_id description | eval last=strftime(last,"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M") | sort - count</query>
          <earliest>$time.earliest$</earliest>
          <latest>$time.latest$</latest>
        </search>
        <option name="drilldown">none</option>
        <option name="count">10</option>
        <option name="wrap">true</option>
        <option name="rowNumbers">false</option>
      </table>
    </panel>
  </row>

  <row>
    <panel>
      <title>Security 4932/4933: replica sync start/end</title>
      <html><p>Requires the audit policy "Audit Detailed Directory Service Replication" (Security events 4932/4933).</p></html>
      <table>
        <search>
          <query>`adx_security_events` (EventCode=4932 OR EventCode=4933) | eval dc=coalesce(Computer, ComputerName, host), status_code=coalesce(Status_Code, StatusCode, Status), naming_context=coalesce(Naming_Context, NamingContext), source_dra=coalesce(Source_DRA, SourceDRA) | stats count, sum(eval(if(EventCode=4933 AND status_code!="0",1,0))) as failed_syncs by dc naming_context | sort - failed_syncs</query>
          <earliest>$time.earliest$</earliest>
          <latest>$time.latest$</latest>
        </search>
        <option name="drilldown">none</option>
        <option name="count">8</option>
        <option name="wrap">true</option>
        <option name="rowNumbers">false</option>
      </table>
    </panel>
    <panel>
      <title>Kerberos clock-skew failures (event 4771, code 0x25) - time sync</title>
      <html><p>Clients whose clock drifts more than 5 minutes from the DC: a typical side effect of broken AD time synchronisation.</p></html>
      <table>
        <search>
          <query>`adx_security_events` EventCode=4771 (Failure_Code=0x25 OR Result_Code=0x25) | eval client=coalesce(IpAddress, Client_Address, src_ip), user=coalesce(TargetUserName, Account_Name) | stats count, latest(_time) as last by client user | eval last=strftime(last,"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M") | sort - count</query>
          <earliest>$time.earliest$</earliest>
          <latest>$time.latest$</latest>
        </search>
        <option name="drilldown">none</option>
        <option name="count">8</option>
        <option name="wrap">true</option>
        <option name="rowNumbers">false</option>
      </table>
    </panel>
  </row>
</form>
